PARITY (web SignalDiffTable.tsx → native)
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Data sources : useTelemetry (SignalDiffRow[]) → SignalDiffTableSource (P1/S8 seam) ; useTranslation →
                 SignalDiffTableStrings (P1/S10 facade). No transport in the view.
  Shared maps  : DataTable(virtualized,selectable=multi,stickyHeader)→adaptive Grid (macOS/iPad) + card list
                 (iPhone) with a leading selection toggle ; PinButton(item_type=widget,context=
                 signal-diff:vehicle:N)→pin toggle (optimistic float, pin.pin/pin.unpin labels) ;
                 HelpTooltip(Δ, Src A / Src B)→legend chips with info popover (.help + popover) ;
                 SourceLayerBadge(l1/l2/log/stale/unknown + ageMs)→tinted mono badge w/ tooltip = desc+age.
  Pure logic   : fmtNumber→groupedNumber (locale grouping, minFrac=maxFrac=decimals, halfUp, safeNumber) ;
                 asNumber / formatRaw / deltaLabel (num/changed/none) / the signed-delta+pct cell string /
                 formatAge — all ported 1:1 and pinned by tests.
  Columns      : pin · Signal (sortable, mono) · Window A (mono, secondary) · Window B (mono, primary) ·
                 Δ (sortable; +emerald / -rose / 0-muted numeric, amber "changed", muted em-dash none) ·
                 Src A · Src B (L1/L2/LOG/STALE/— badges). sortedRows = pinned-first then name (default).
  States       : loading("Loading…") · empty — BOTH web variants reproduced
                 (filterActive→"No signals match the current filter", else "No differences between the two
                 snapshots") · content · plus the feature-level error(retry) / stale / offline chrome the web
                 delegates to its host. EVERY state renders — no hidden surface.
  i18n         : every web key (signalDiff.signal/valueA/valueB/delta/deltaChanged/sourceA/sourceB/
                 tableNoMatches/tableEmpty/tableLoading + legend.* + help.signal.* + sourceLayer.*.desc +
                 pin.pin/pin.unpin) + native chrome resolve through the per-surface "SignalDiffTable" .strings
                 table (web English as the fallback value); no English literal in native code. Shipped as a
                 per-surface table (NOT edited into the shared Localizable.xcstrings — parallel-unsafe).
  a11y         : each row collapses to one VoiceOver element (combined name/windows/Δ/sources/pinned summary)
                 with .isSelected trait + rotor actions for select + pin; sortable headers labelled +
                 value(sorted asc/desc) + hint; source badges + info buttons + retry labelled; Dynamic Type via
